OL,3,GNEWSAMan killed by damaged power line  
OL,4,Ain field named                         
OL,6,FThere is no evidence a man who died    
OL,7,Fafter after he was electrocuted by a   
OL,8,Fdamaged power line in a field was      
OL,9,Finvolved in any criminal activity      
OL,10,Fbefore his death, police have said.    
OL,12,FKevin Walkden died on Sunday after     
OL,13,Fcoming into contact with the line while
OL,14,Fwalking near South Moor Lane in        
OL,15,FKnottingley at about 14:00 GMT.        
OL,17,FNorthern Powergrid previously said the 
OL,18,Fline was thought to have been "the     
OL,19,Fsubject of attempted theft", but West  
OL,20,FYorkshire Police have since said how   
OL,21,Fthe cable came to be exposed "remain   
OL,22,Funclear".                              
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
