OL,3,GNEWSAMan killed by damaged power line  
OL,4,Ain field named                         
OL,6,FDet Ch Insp Stacey Atkinson from the   
OL,7,Fforce said there was "nothing to       
OL,8,Fsupport" any suggestion the 58-year-old
OL,9,Fwas involved in an attempt to interfere
OL,10,Fwith, steal or damage the cable.       
